[SIZE="4"][B]Install instructions:[/B][/SIZE]
[LIST=1]
[*]Unlock the bootloader and install TWRP (links above). The phone must be on firmware [B]D62510c[/B].
[*]In TWRP, make a [B]full backup[/B] (System, Data, Boot) and copy it to your PC.
[*]Wipe [B]Data, Cache and Dalvik cache[/B] (factory reset). Coming from the LG stock ROM, a wipe is required.
[*]Flash the ROM zip.
[*](Optional) Flash a KitKat GApps package.
[*]Reboot. The first boot takes several minutes while apps are optimized.
[/LIST]

[B]Going back to stock:[/B] restore your TWRP backup.

